{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/554916-question-was-there-a-last-minute-revision-to-vigil","id":554916,"title":"Question: Was there a last-minute revision to Vigil?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Hunter: The Vigil"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-06-14T15:23:21-07:00","id":554916,"title":"Question: Was there a last-minute revision to Vigil?","content":"I heard over on RPGnet that the fluff rejiggering we're seeing over at the Beast kickstarter is nothing new for the nWoD, with Hunter: the Vigil being brought up as something that happened privately just before its release.<br /> <br /> Was this true (I've been suckered by gossip before), and if so, can anyone tell me what happened?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.us/a/img824/1346/mosz.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/180-leliel","name":"Leliel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar180_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2259"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-14T15:36:35-07:00","id":554941,"title":"","content":"Can I get a summary of what's being rejiggered over at the Kickstarter?<br /> <br /> More pertinently, I'd also like to know about this. Especially since there's a bit of a difference between Hunter portrayals in oW and nW.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I have decided, after some thought, that I don't really feel happy on these forums. I might decide to come back to post. Who knows - but right now, I'm gone.<br /> <br /> So good bye, good luck, and have a nice day.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1170-amechra","name":"amechra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1170_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2316"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-14T17:34:31-07:00","id":555040,"title":"","content":"Hunter having last minute changes was also mentioned on the Beast comments section, by Rose. '<span style=\"color:#0F2105\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica Neue\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">This kind of thing used to happen entirely in secret -- like the major late-stage revisions that took place on Hunter: The Vigil, or on the Nosferatu clanbook. These days... all out in the open. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />'</span></span></span><br /> <br /> @amechra So far we just have the introduction. You can see it <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/folderview?id=0B66tiMNn-_PVflpVYlNrQWJXcjRKekdFRmpRdF9ybU5WRzRIc2JmOGdUdUwyaE1SeVBSaFU&amp;usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>. Since it's just the introduction it doesn't go into too much depth, but the basic idea is that there's a solid theme of using fear to bring wisdom to humanity, or not if you just want to be a monster. Heroes are more like Beasts in that they're part of the story-that-teaches, except they get caught up in the adulation for being Heroes rather than granting wisdom and so decide to just go on murder sprees for that. Also the way the Beast is created is more open, where essentially the Beast's Soul, called a Horror, confronts your dreamers soul for what it is and offers you a choice to Become.<br /> <br /> Kinda curious about what happened with the Nosferatu clanbook, too.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":886,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","user":"nofather","date":".  Found the post. 06-14-2015, 08:41 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-14T20:30:17-07:00","id":555154,"title":"","content":"Matt said so here <a href=\"http://theonyxpath.com/beastrevisions/\" target=\"_blank\">http://theonyxpath.com/beastrevisions/</a>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1526-diggs","name":"Diggs","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"986"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}